feat: black skin + in-place silent color cycling (v0.3.6)

- 4th skin: black #24292f (GitHub Primer canvas.fg), neutral in both
  light and dark themes; DESIGN.md palette table updated
- color cycling is now in-place: no toast (the note span used to push
  the button out of position), color cross-fades via 0.18s stroke
  transition on the SVG path
- left-click with empty input now cycles color (was a dead
  "enter something first" nag); triple-click self-check preserved
- right-click still cycles; keyword peek takes precedence as before